Feature #167 (capture speed 25x), Eye of the Storm follow-up.

The 25x capture speed shipped as rev_pvp_capture_25x.sql, which sets
GO Data16 on the data-driven capture points (EP towers, Hellfire, Halaa,
Zangar, Venture Bay, Terokkar, Nagrand, Wintergrasp banners). Eye of the
Storm is NOT data-driven: its four towers use BattlegroundEY's code-driven
progress bar, so Data16 has no effect there.

Change: the per-tick bar delta in BattlegroundEY::UpdatePointsState()
(player-count difference, clamped to +/- BG_EY_POINT_MAX_CAPTURERS_COUNT)
is multiplied by BG_EY_CAPTURE_SPEED_MULT (25) before being applied. The
delta is clamped to the bar's own 0..100 range on the next line, so the
larger step cannot push the int8 status out of range. One capturer now
captures a tower from neutral in ~2 ticks instead of ~14, matching the
feel of the 25x data-driven points.

Touches: src/server/game/Battlegrounds/Zones/BattlegroundEY.{h,cpp}
